r: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en.html" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4AF680" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/qantas-header-banner.jpg" title="Qantas" style="width: 680px;"></a></td></tr></tbody></table><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="main-content" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B0490" style="text-align: center; width: 600px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B06F0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B0950"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B0BB0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: left;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B1060"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B12C0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B1520"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B1780" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 40px; height: 30px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B1FB0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B2210" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">Dear Agency Partner,</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B26D0"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B2930" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B2DF0"><td align="left" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3050" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">We're pleased to provide your Agency access to Qantas Tier 4 fares.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D56F680"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D56F570">Tier 4 fares are nett fares designed for corporate customers who do not have a Qantas commercial agreement.<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000009187EE0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3950">Please find attached our Qantas Tier 4 clue card, where you will find information around fares, eligibility, access and ticketing.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3840"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3600">Please note, if a Tier 4 fare is issued for one of your Qantas Business Rewards (QBR) members, the business will not be eligible to earn QBR points for their business. As a Qantas Frequent Flyer, the individual travelling will still earn Qantas Frequent Flyer Points as normal.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B34F0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B32B0">If you have any questions or require further information, please let us know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3B90"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3CA0">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B3EE0">Agency Partnerships and Leisure Sales<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B4120"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B4230"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B4470">Qantas Airways Limited</em></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B4A60"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B4CC0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B5180"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B4B53E0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D565A90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D565CF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D565F50" style="width: 680px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D5661B0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D566410"><td align="center" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D566670" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="680" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D5668D0" style="font-size: 10px; background-color: rgb(244, 245, 246);"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D566B30"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D566D90"><td data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D566FF0" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D5674B0"><td align="center" valign="top" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D567710" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><table align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D567970" style="margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><tbody data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D567BD0"><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D567E30"><td align="left" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D568090" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px;">&nbsp;</td><td align="right" valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D568420" style="font-variant-ligatures: none; font-size: 14px; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); line-height: 20px; text-align: right; width: 167px;"><a href="https://www.qantas.com/" target="_blank" data_liveedit_tagid="000000002D568680" style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); text-decoration-line: none; border: 0px;"><img border="0" src="https://www.qantas.com/content/dam/qantas/sales-news/salesforce-email-assets/QF-oneworld-logo-lockup.png" title="Qantas" width="166" data_livee